  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Each row's LEADING cell is a header: the row's non-zeros take its color\n ;; (an empty header leaves them unchanged).\n (grid-from-fn h w (lambda (r c)\n   (let ((header (at g r 0)) (v (at g r c)))\n     (if (= v 0) 0 (if (= header 0) v header))))))",
